+IP sample mode inputs, patch 1 (no RUN lines)
+============================================
+Purpose: frozen design v0.7 5.2.2, 5.3, 5.4, 5.7.2, 5.10.
+Design SHA256: eec6b208d8e1fedb840f0933eb20a37c188890b6c8c29e43986c5c9bbca9f6be.
+All new binaries are synthetic, never executed on a board. Existing profgen
+sources/tests are unchanged. Binary suffixes .perfbin/.debug and .perfscript
+follow nearby inputs. C/.s/.lds sources are provided; no executable tests yet.
+
+Reproduction: commands.txt contains each complete generation command, working
+directory and scratch directory setup; tools.txt contains actual paths/versions.
+All compiler/linker/objcopy commands use the loader+libraries from the indicated
+GBS root. Sources are relative to this directory. No GBS build is required.
+
+Binary input inventory (generation: corresponding [filename] in commands.txt):
